<% @title="| Frequently Asked Questions" %>

<div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500">
        Everything you need to know to get started.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">What is SynthMonitor?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">SynthMonitor runs automated browser tests against your production application on a schedule. If a critical user flow like login, checkout, or signup breaks, you'll know about it before your customers do.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">What's included in the free trial?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">You get 30 days of full access — no credit card required. Create monitors, set up schedules, and receive alerts just like a paid account.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Can I cancel anytime?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes. There are no contracts or commitments. You can cancel your account at any time from your settings page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Do I need to write code to create monitors?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">No. SynthMonitor includes a no-code test builder that lets you define multi-step browser flows by configuring steps like navigate, click, and fill — no scripting required.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">What forms of payment are accepted?</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We accept all major credit cards through Stripe. No payment is required during the trial period.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
